###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                               <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Dynamics> ;
