                                              <https://w3id.org/tvbo/modelsAnatomicalRegion> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000956> ;
                                              <https://w3id.org/tvbo/modelsCellType> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0000099> ,
