                                                      <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "g_Cl*(V + 26.64*log(Cl_o0/Cl_i0))" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/I_K
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/I_K> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
