###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/Vcond
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx/derived_variables/Vcond> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> ;
