###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/ModelJansen1995/parameters/C
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ModelJansen1995/parameters/C> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                              <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> ;
                                                     <http://schema.org/defaultValue> 135 ;
