###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/ModelJansen1995/state_variables/y3
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ModelJansen1995/state_variables/y3> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                    <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> ;
