                                                           <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "A*a*Sigm(y1 - y2) - 2*a*y3 - a**2*y0" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/ModelJansen1995/state_variables/y4
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ModelJansen1995/state_variables/y4> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
