                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Position of the maximum slope of the excitatory response function S_e_WC (Sanz-Leon et al., 2015)." ;
                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "b_e" .


