###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/derived_variables/T_m_i
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/derived_variables/T_m_i> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
