###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/derived_variables/V_thre_e
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/derived_variables/V_thre_e> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
